## ⚙️ Settings: System Configuration

### **Settings Categories**

#### **General Settings**
- **System Name**: Customizable system identifier
- **Timezone**: Local timezone configuration
- **Date/Time Format**: Display preferences
- **Language**: Interface language (if multilingual)
- **Auto-backup**: Scheduled backup configuration

#### **Camera Settings**
- **Default Resolution**: New camera default (1920x1080, 1280x720, etc.)
- **Default Frame Rate**: New camera default (30, 25, 15 FPS)
- **Recording Duration**: How long to keep recordings (days)
- **Auto-discovery**: Automatic camera detection on network
- **Stream Timeout**: Connection timeout settings

#### **Detection Settings**
- **Confidence Threshold**: Minimum confidence for valid detection (80%)
- **Detection Model**: AI model selection (YOLO v8, v10, custom)
- **Image Enhancement**: Enable/disable image preprocessing
- **Real-time Processing**: Enable/disable live detection
- **Batch Processing**: Configure batch detection settings

#### **Alert Settings**
- **Alert Thresholds**: Configure when alerts trigger
- **Notification Methods**: Email, SMS, push notifications
- **Escalation Rules**: Auto-escalate unresolved alerts
- **Quiet Hours**: Suppress non-critical alerts during specific times

#### **User Management**
- **User Accounts**: Add, edit, remove users
- **Role Assignments**: Administrator, Operator, Viewer roles
- **Permission Management**: Fine-grained access controls
- **Session Management**: Login timeouts, concurrent sessions

#### **Security Settings**
- **Password Policies**: Complexity requirements
- **Two-Factor Authentication**: Enable/configure 2FA
- **API Keys**: Generate and manage API access
- **Audit Logging**: Configure audit trail settings
- **Encryption**: Data encryption settings

#### **System Maintenance**
- **Backup & Restore**: Manual and scheduled backups
- **Log Management**: Log retention and rotation
- **System Updates**: Software update management
- **Diagnostics**: System health check tools
- **Storage Management**: Data cleanup and optimization

